---
import { getSocialLink } from '../consts';
import AboutView from '../views/AboutView.astro';

const github = getSocialLink('github');
---

<AboutView>
	<p>
		I'm Kai Chen, an iOS engineer in the San Francisco Bay Area. I've spent 13 years building iOS
		apps, including at Facebook, Airbnb, and Pinterest.
	</p>
	<p>
		Lately I'm most interested in how AI agents change the way large apps get built, and how you
		verify what they produce.
	</p>
	<p>
		This site is my decision log. I write down what I believe and why before I know how it turns
		out, so I can come back later and check what held up. I mostly write about three things:
	</p>
	<p slot="after">You can also find my code on <a href={github.href}>GitHub</a>.</p>
</AboutView>
